WEBVTT

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:37.130
It's urgent, Professor.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.130
Four oil companies disappeared in one night.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:43.820
What the hell is going on?

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:47.350
Nekiru, bring the Jet-G team to the lab.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.290
It's urgent.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:52.290
Benkei, stop eating like a pig.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:55.300
I'm not eating, I'm having breakfast.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.300
Then try not to swallow the chocolate.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Let him eat.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.600
A conversation can offer you life.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.400
Did you hear that? Get out of here! Daddy is waiting for us!

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.280
I'm coming! I'm coming!

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:30.000
Get out of here!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.300
He's hurt. I think he needs to be treated.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.900
You're right, poor thing. He's sick. What could he have done?

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.300
Listen, Benkey, could you take care of him?

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.100
Of course, I'm very expert. I did a veterinary course at the university, you'll see.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.600
Benkey, what are you doing? Didn't you understand that the professor is waiting for us?

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.600
Corbezzo, he's coming. It's only a matter of a minute, isn't it?

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.210
- Are you coming? - Wait!

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:55.090
Then bye. I'm not in your comfort zone.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:02:00.000
100 tons, 200, 300, 400 tons.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:03.140
with four fuel tanks mysteriously disappeared.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.990
But perhaps the most probable thing is that they are all sunk, professor.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:09.990
Yes, but in this case on the surface you should find some milk

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:13.990
and on our sonars should appear some echo, instead there is nothing.

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.990
It's too big a job for a pirate ship.

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:19.990
Personally, the whole affair leaves me puzzled.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.990
It seems to be the work of very well-prepared people.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.990
Yes, like the Empire of the Demons.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.410
I had the same impression.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.730
But the problem is, why the oil companies, if they wanted the oil, could acquire wells?

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:39.160
Why start catching ships? It's an absurd undertaking.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:48.770
Hello, why are you all there? It's time for training, don't you think about it anymore?

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:53.320
Yes, about training, we have to tighten the times if we want to observe the program.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.600
The schedules must be at least doubled.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.600
What? Double work, Professor?

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.000
Naturally, and to start from now.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.260
- Go! - I don't know what to do!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.610
- Go with Poseidon! - All right, Professor!

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.180
Raise the crane by 80 degrees!

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:55.500
According to your orders, we are working on the modification of the captured oilfields, General.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.680
Very well, let me know when you're done.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.000
Certainly, sir.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:06.600
With all due respect, I'm glad to inform you that the Petroleum Operation is proceeding well.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.880
If we manage to spread all the fuel in the Petroliere,

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:13.880
Professor Sao Tomei will not be able to remain hidden underground for too long.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.890
We could set fire to the fuel and make them come out like mice, General Hitler.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.890
I hope there will be no mistakes this time.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.890
Of course, General Hitler, allow me to insist again.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:30.000
This plan was devised by me, and I absolutely do not want you to fail.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.800
I don't want him to fail.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:37.200
Why don't you take the command of the operation?

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:41.000
No, the responsibility of the maneuvers must be all yours.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:45.600
I'm a political adviser and you're the military executor.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.450
Guller is right, General.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:56.530
Take the command, so that the work can be done quickly.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.500
- Greetings, General Hitler. - How are things going?

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.580
- Look, sir. - Oh!

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:55.960
- We can attack at any time. - Then be ready for orders.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.390
One more time! When are we going to eat?

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:21.690
Stop complaining, Benkei. It's for you that we're continuing training.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.460
Let's converge on you, Benkei!

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.850
Benkei, contact made.

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.850
Change, change, change...

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.850
Poseidon switch, don't you remember?

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:46.850
Right, Poseidon switch, go!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.790
Attention, red correction!

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.790
Benkei, the maneuvers are too fast!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:56.150
Poseidon switch, go!

00:06:57.150 --> 00:07:00.000
What's going on, Benkei?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.250
They're all running away.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.250
Maybe Mount Azama is about to erupt.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.250
Please, Professor, check me.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:11.920
How is Mount Azama possible?

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.810
Check the seismographs.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.810
Right away, Professor. No anomalies of relief.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.830
Benkei, think about our maneuvers and don't worry about anything else.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.840
Really, Professor, something strange is happening.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.840
Benkei, listen to my father. Think only about the right side.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.000
All right, I got it. Interruption change.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.310
I'm so lazy this time.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.220
Oh, my God! Watch what you do!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:50.220
Hey, did you see? There were some ships flying!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.220
I wouldn't say so. How do ships fly?

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.220
Get out of here!

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.050
You should behave more seriously during training.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.950
They have the DNA of the Devil.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.900
Daddy, there are some Petroliere flying.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.900
I think they are the disappeared ones.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:13.810
Mikiru, don't get close, stay away.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:16.760
Quickly, check the direction of flight of those Petroliere.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.060
Professor, do we have to attack them before they attack us?

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.060
No, it's better not.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.060
Those ships could explode from the moment I'm fully loaded.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.060
It's better to wait and see what their intentions are.

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:29.830
It's better to wait and see what their intentions are.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:46.730
Those miserable people at Sao Tome's lab will be dead by now.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:53.430
De Montoro, let's start Operation Petroliere del Cielo.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:46.630
Quick landing!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:50.630
Squadra Jet-A-G, attention, do your best to put out the fire!

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.310
Roger!

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:58.800
Hook the anti-fire capsules!

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:05.960
Oh, my God! Our anti-fire action is not enough!

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:22.840
Benkey, where are you going? Go back! Benkey!

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.840
You didn't know what was going on. That's why you escaped from the forest.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:27.840
Well done! You did a good job!

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:45.500
Very well, De Montoro. They will have to leave one day or another and then we will attack them and

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.960
we will take their amplifier to Raggi Jetta.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.940
Wonderful!

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:54.710
Professor, the fire is too big to be smoked.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:11:00.000
I'll have to wait for it to go out on its own. I wonder what they intend to do by burning all that

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.000
Professor, the intensity of the jet ray is decreasing rapidly.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.020
What did you say?

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:10.570
Incredible. Some additives must have been added to that naphtha.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.570
Electronic special additives?

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:14.580
I think so.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:20.250
That black smoke must act as a filter capable of stopping jet rays.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:27.460
Raise the dome with the emergency collector and point it towards the smoke.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.990
- You're in position, ma'am. - Good job.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:47.890
Rio, Ayato. I need to supply energy.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.710
Professor, Demo-Robo is on the oil rig.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:04.940
We need more energy, we need to get more of it!

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:07.940
Mikiru, our emergency collector has been destroyed.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:10.940
The energy we have must be enough just to work.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:14.770
But I think it won't be enough even to be able to depend on us, Kappa!

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:17.770
Don't worry, Professor, we'll do everything we need!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.770
And even if Benkei hadn't stopped, we could get into action.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:23.280
That boy always wants to do everything on his own.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.280
He doesn't deserve to pilot Poseidon.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.280
There's no point in arguing now.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.000
Go look for Benkei and tell him to come back immediately.

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.030
Rio, Hayato, Hayato!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:35.380
All right.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:44.690
Well done, now you'll be fine, you'll see.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:47.610
Put the shadow where there is a little bit of wind.

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:49.040
Right away, Benkei.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:52.630
Hi, Rio, Hayato, have you come to give me a hand?

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:55.880
There are still many animals that need to be cared for here.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.880
Benkei, there are many other things to do.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.000
And you are part of our team, don't you remember?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.000
I know! Of course I know, but I can't let all these animals suffer!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.000
Benkei, we don't have a second to lose!

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:11.000
Do you know what will happen to Japan if the laboratory falls into their hands?

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.000
People will be killed, not just animals!

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:16.000
If you're so in a hurry, find someone else!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.000
Genki, are you done up there?

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.840
Listen to me well, Benkei!

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:25.850
Demon learning is trying with every means to conquer the world and you keep talking about animals!

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:27.850
But what's more important, animals or people?

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:30.000
Yours is just a stupid philanthropy.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:33.000
Nothing at all. You're wrong. People are interested in me too.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:36.000
But right now it's the animals that need help.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:40.000
Hey, Benkei, I'm ready. Let's go get the other animals.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.000
Yes, I'm coming.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.000
Insane madman.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.240
Now they should be alive very soon.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.760
So Benkei said what to do.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.760
Yes, he's busy taking care of the animals. We can't trust him anymore.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.770
If we still waste time in the same laboratory, it will stop working.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:14:00.000
We just have to start fighting alone and hope that God will help us.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:07.150
Professor, the smoke curtain is starting to dissipate.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:10.070
This is a good opportunity for a supply of energy.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.070
Rio, Hayato, I'll get the collector out again.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.530
So we'll fall into their trap.

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:20.530
If we can't get a supply of energy, the lab will stop anyway.

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.530
Then the best thing is to fight the robot jets.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.510
Let's go, quickly!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:28.420
On your legs, please!

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:30.000
Quick rise!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:38.890
Quick lift!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.890
Finally! Here they are!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:56.600
Dragon, Ligard, go!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.910
- Come on, get to work! - Yes, sir!

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:20.180
They're trying something.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:24.360
- How's the energy flow? - It's slightly increased.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.360
Rio, don't attack.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.000
- Let's wait for them to show their intentions. - Yes, sir!

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:35.430
They want to master the Amplifier at Jetta radius.

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:37.430
- In action, Jetta Robot! - Received!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:49.640
- Air-to-Land missiles, go! - Air-to-Land missiles, go!

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:57.100
Release the Mega Demon Robot for action!

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.280
It was time for him to show up.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:26.720
To the laboratory!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.480
They are sweet!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.300
- And I saved them! - Bravo!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:15.750
The devil is evil!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:18.210
I won't forgive her!

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:39.530
We've fed enough of them. Now we have to destroy the lab!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.230
Hey, Benkey!

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:46.660
Hayato, quick! Let's go together!

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:47.660
Very well!

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.660
Dragon Transformation!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.160
Go!

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:29.050
- Action! - Keep her away from the lab! - Roger!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.480
It's up to you. The Demons will win.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.400
All right, Ryo. Now it's my turn.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.400
No, Hayato! Let me take care of it!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.400
What?

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:45.400
We're not ready now. It's too hard for you to make it.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.400
Why do you want to risk so much?

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:51.400
They killed all the animals I saved at the risk of my life!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.440
I have to take revenge!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.300
No! A true warrior never fights for personal gains.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.310
Hayato, think about it!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.000
One moment. Something is wrong.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.660
It must be the cooling system!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.280
Damn it! You're right!

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:13.020
Disunite Jet and Robot!

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:19.520
Poseidon transformation, go!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.510
And the backrests!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:04.700
Do you get it, huh?

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:09.700
Professor, that blessed Benkei guy is really worth a lot, especially when he puts everything in it.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:15.150
Yes, but unfortunately his personality is unpredictable.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:19.270
The Empire of Demons will have to kill me before conquering my land!
